  "solution": {
    "text": "Modulating index is given by, <br/><math><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>400</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/><math><mo>=</mo><mn>0.25</mn></math>  <br/>The difference between the maximum frequency of modulated wave and the minimum frequency of modulated wave is given by <br/><math><mi>Δ</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub></math>  <br/><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>  <br/><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></math>  <br/><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>100</mn><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>)</mo></math>  <br/><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math>",
